{"skill":{"slug":"daily-digest","displayName":"Daily Digest"},"version":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770227706597,"changelog":"Initial release of the daily-digest skill.\n\n- Generates a daily digest from memory and interactions, saved as journals/digest/digest-YYYY-MM-DD.md.\n- Run the digest_daily.py script manually or automate with a scheduler.\n- Extracts decisions, lessons, actions, and questions from daily memory files.\n- Includes a placeholder summary if no structured entries are found.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"README.md","size":420,"sha256":"acf4c0b7fe25f674d01422e3a85a3b592dda60882f08745ff6115ad7ca84ab8e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":529,"sha256":"544d93709233cbf2478da99f988712e2ff3b57cd3688771af307602131bd236e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"digest_daily.py","size":3609,"sha256":"0da8d6460f005cca23e48acd907deaf283e0d6d0fc0eb2815026874a1dd6dbb5","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":1729,"sha256":"46b7eca07cfcecbe12eefc41828096d2ac31046972fee5f3fca79048972120fa","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789033064127,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"37c49bb253319721cdaaf4da207171ffec2de0e09e7c59262579e9d5521e5fb0","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/37c49bb253319721cdaaf4da207171ffec2de0e09e7c59262579e9d5521e5fb0","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: daily-digest\nVersion: 1.0.0\n\nThe OpenClaw AgentSkills skill bundle 'daily-digest' is benign. The `digest_daily.py` script reads specific Markdown files from a 'memory' directory and writes a new Markdown digest file to a 'journals/digest' directory, all within the expected operational scope. There is no evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, persistence mechanisms, or prompt injection attempts in `SKILL.md` or `README.md`. All file operations are localized and aligned with the stated purpose of generating a daily summary.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779161335167},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":16,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789033064127},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill reads dated memory notes and writes a daily digest file, which matches its stated purpose and shows no hidden network, credential, destructive, or privilege behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Local file access is limited to dated memory files and the digest output directory, which is proportionate for a digest generator.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"No installer, dependency setup, remote retrieval, or automatic execution mechanism is present in the artifact.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions disclose reading memory files and writing a digest; there are minor quality issues such as French fixed headings and a mention of yesterday's memory that is read but not actually used.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The README and skill text mention optional scheduling via cron, but the package does not install persistence itself; users should understand scheduled use will create recurring digest files.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is to generate a daily digest from memory notes into journals/digest/digest-YYYY-MM-DD.md, and the script performs that limited read/write workflow.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with the skill reading your dated memory notes and writing daily Markdown summaries under journals/digest. If you schedule it with cron, expect a new digest file to be created each day it runs.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The fixed French section headings are a localization and usability limitation, not a security concern or purpose mismatch.\n[SQP-2] expected: Repeated digest file creation is inherent to an optional daily digest workflow and is disclosed as a saved output, though the documentation could state file accumulation more explicitly.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789033064127}}}}}